{"unit_id": "tag:09ZH:proof", "translation": "回顾任意环（ring）的谱（spectrum）都是谱空间（spectral space），参见《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0001>。由《代数（Algebra）补充》引理<REF_0002>，可见<MATH_0001>对每个<MATH_0002>都是连通（connected）的。由引理<REF_0003>，可见该陈述对<MATH_0003>上的层（sheaves）成立。对任意有限（finite）态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>，有<MATH_0005>及<MATH_0006>，其中<MATH_0007>是 Hensel 对（henselian pair），参见《代数（Algebra）补充》引理<REF_0004>，从而对<MATH_0008>上的层（sheaves）得到同一陈述。因此可以应用引理<REF_0005>得出结论。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "spectral space", "target_term": "谱空间"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "connected", "target_term": "连通"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "henselian pair", "target_term": "Hensel 对"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "谱的定义域。"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱", "context": "环的谱。"}, {"source_term": "spectral space", "target_term": "谱空间", "context": "谱的拓扑性质。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "引用章节名称。"}, {"source_term": "connected", "target_term": "连通", "context": "闭集交的性质。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "结论涉及的层。"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "态射性质。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "有限态射。"}, {"source_term": "henselian pair", "target_term": "Hensel 对", "context": "有限基变换后的 Hensel 对。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:09ZI:proof", "translation": "结论对<MATH_0001>成立，依据引理<REF_0001>。设<MATH_0002>。假设结论已在所有次数（degrees）<MATH_0003>上证明。设<MATH_0004>为扭（torsion）阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）。设<MATH_0005>为扭（torsion）阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）之间的单射（injective map）（稍后选取），其余核（cokernel）为<MATH_0006>，从而有短正合列（short exact sequence）<MATH_0007>，这是<MATH_0008>上的扭（torsion）阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）之间的序列。这给出<MATH_0009>及<MATH_0010>上的长正合上同调（cohomology）序列之间的映射（map），其一部分形如<MATH_0011>。利用这一阿贝尔群（abelian groups）的交换图（commutative diagram），其各行为正合（exact）的，我们将完成证明。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n<MATH_0012>的单射性（Injectivity）。设<MATH_0013>为非零（nonzero）元素（element），属于<MATH_0014>。应用引理<REF_0002>，取<MATH_0015>（！），可以找到<MATH_0016>，使得<MATH_0017>向右映到（maps）零。那么<MATH_0018>是某个元素（element）的像（image），该元素属于<MATH_0019>；<MATH_0020>的双射性（bijectivity）蕴含<MATH_0021>在<MATH_0022>中不映到（map）零。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n<MATH_0023>的满射性（Surjectivity）。设<MATH_0024>为元素（element），属于<MATH_0025>。应用引理<REF_0003>，取<MATH_0026>，可以找到<MATH_0027>，使得<MATH_0028>向右映到（maps）零。那么<MATH_0029>是某个元素（element）的像（image），该元素属于<MATH_0030>；<MATH_0031>的双射性（bijectivity）蕴含<MATH_0032>在竖直映射（map）的像（image）中。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "degrees", "target_term": "次数"}, {"source_term": "torsion", "target_term": "扭"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaf", "target_term": "阿贝尔层"}, {"source_term": "torsion", "target_term": "扭"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaves", "target_term": "阿贝尔层"}, {"source_term": "injective map", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "cokernel", "target_term": "余核"}, {"source_term": "short exact sequence", "target_term": "短正合列"}, {"source_term": "torsion", "target_term": "扭"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaves", "target_term": "阿贝尔层"}, {"source_term": "cohomology", "target_term": "上同调"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "exact", "target_term": "正合"}, {"source_term": "Injectivity", "target_term": "单射性"}, 